=== num-pow-fractional-root
from: Math::SpecialFunctions 0.1.1 lib/Math/SpecialFunctions.rakumod:103
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: infix **
--- code
for 4, 8, 16 -> $precision {
    my $n = ceiling( (1e0 / (10e0 ** -$precision)) ** (1/4e0) );
    say "$precision: $n";
}
--- expect
4: 10
8: 100
16: 10000
